{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35219","headline":"哭刘驾博士 · 聂夷中","name":"哭刘驾博士","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"出门四顾望，此日何徘徊。\n终南旧山色，夫子安在哉。\n君诗如门户，夕闭昼还开。\n君名如四时，春尽夏复来。\n原野多丘陵，累累如高台。\n君坟须数尺，谁与夫子偕。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"聂夷中","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35219.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35219","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}